 3334 1843 3395 Q 2035 3456 2253 3456 Q 2752 3456 3017 3187 Q 3283 2918 3283 2490 L 3283 102 Q 3283 0 3187 0 L 2829 0 Q 2784 0 2765 22 Q 2746 45 2746 83 L 2746 2368 Q 2746 2682 2586 2858 Q 2426 3034 2080 3034 Q 1894 3034 1731 2973 Q 1568 2912 1401 2800 Q 1235 2688 1030 2515 L 1030 96 Q 1030 0 934 0 L 582 0 L 582 0 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/><path id=\"LibreFranklin-Regular-5a\" d=\"M 1037 109 Q 1037 45 1011 22 Q 986 0 922 0 L 589 0 Q 493 0 493 90 L 499 4659 Q 499 4749 576 4749 L 960 4749 Q 1037 4749 1037 4666 L 1037 109 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-15\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-69\" transform=\"translate(73.90625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-5e\" transform=\"translate(110.90625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-73\" transform=\"translate(169.015625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-6c\" transform=\"translate(248.609375 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-4f\" transform=\"translate(287.3125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-a5\" transform=\"translate(345.71875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-66\" transform=\"translate(367.125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-5e\" transform=\"translate(426.828125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-6c\" transform=\"translate(485.4375 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-48\" transform=\"translate(522.84375 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-5c\" transform=\"translate(580.9375 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-6c\" transform=\"translate(638.046875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-50\" transform=\"translate(676.75 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-3b\" transform=\"translate(700.65625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-5a\" transform=\"translate(755.453125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-a5\" transform=\"translate(779.359375 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-bd\" transform=\"translate(800.765625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-1f\" transform=\"translate(829.359375 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-be\" transform=\"translate(919.953125 0)\"/></g></g></g></g></g><defs><clipPath id=\"p3425950aa8\"><rect x=\"28.465\" y=\"27.296\" width=\"345.96\" height=\"155.232\"/></clipPath></defs></svg>\n","title":"Exhibit 1 · Visitors by source market, millions","note":"Growth potential = analyst estimate of extra visitors by 2033 with better flights and visas. Most GCC visitors arrive by road; Europe, South Asia and others arrive by air."},"answer":"<p>Potential growth totals ~5.0M, just enough for the 10M target, with <b>Europe and South Asia</b> making up ~70% of it. These are long-haul and flight-dependent: new routes and airline deals are critical. GCC visitors mostly drive, so they don't need flights.</p>"},{"q":"What should the government do, and what should it leave to the private sector?","exhibit":null,"answer":"<ul><li><b>Government:</b> e-visa / visa on arrival for priority markets; incentives for airlines on new routes; airport capacity; an events calendar; training nationals for hospitality jobs</li> <li><b>Private sector:</b> build the 18,000 extra rooms (land or tax incentives to attract them); attractions; tour operators</li> <li><b>Both:</b> sustainability standards (water, energy) and protecting the culture that attracts visitors</li></ul>"}],"reco":"Reaching 10 million visitors by 2033 needs ~10% growth a year, and the binding constraints are capacity, not demand. Al Noor needs ~65,000 hotel rooms, about 18,000 beyond today's pipeline, and new flight routes from Europe and South Asia, which offer ~70% of the growth. I recommend that government focuses on visas, airline route deals, events and a national workforce programme, and uses land and tax incentives to bring in private hotel investment. Next step: a joint plan with the national airline for 10 new routes.","great":["Converts visitors into rooms correctly","Checks the model against today's 70% occupancy","Separates public and private roles","Links tourism to the government's real goal (jobs, diversification)"],"id":10,"slug":"visit-al-noor"}